   "n": 2,
   "text": "$$A_{n}-B_{n}=n \\tan x \\left(1-\\cos^{2}x \\right)=n \\tan x \\sin^{2}x,\\,\\,\\,A_{n}-\\frac{l_{n}}{2}=n \\tan x \\left(1-\\cos x \\right)$$",
   "uses": [
    "C1"
   ],
   "title": "차"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "text": "이므로 $\\frac{A_{n}-B_{n}}{A_{n}-\\frac{l_{n}}{2}}=\\frac{\\sin^{2}x}{1-\\cos x}=1+\\cos x$ 이다. 따라서",
   "uses": [
    "C2"
   ],
   "title": "정리"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "$$n^{2}\\left\\{2-\\frac{A_{n}-B_{n}}{A_{n}-\\frac{l_{n}}{2}}\\right\\}=n^{2}\\left(1-\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{n}\\right)=\\pi^{2}\\times \\frac{1-\\cos x}{x^{2}}=\\pi^{2}\\times \\frac{\\sin^{2}x}{x^{2}}\\times \\frac{1}{1+\\cos x}\\to \\frac{\\pi^{2}}{2}$$",
   "uses": [
    "C2"
   ],
   "title": "극한"
  },
